  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可設定額外生物掉落物（Configurable Extra Mob Drops）是一款伺服器端模組，提供為任何實體在死亡時添加額外掉落物品的功能。首次載入時，它會自動產生一個設定檔。您可以手動編輯添加物品，或在遊戲內使用指令進行設定。所有帶有 NBT 標籤的物品皆支援，例如附魔書與已撰寫的書本。模組新增的實體同樣支援，只需在新增包含自訂生物的模組之間，暫時移除或重新命名設定檔即可。若該檔案不存在，系統將自動生成包含所有可能實體類型的預設檔。<br><br>產生的設定檔位於 '<em>./config/configurableextramobdrops/</em>' 資料夾內，檔名為 '<em>mobdropconfig.txt</em>'。掉落機率可透過指令設定，或直接於設定檔中修改。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 客製化套件中\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"運行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd usage</em></span> - 顯示指令用法說明。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd list</em></span> - 列出所有可在 <em>addhand</em> 與 <em>cleardrops</em> 指令中使用的實體名稱。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd reload</em></span> - 重新載入對 mobdropconfig 檔案的所有手動變更。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd addhand &lt;實體名稱&gt;</em></span> - 將主手持有的物品添加為指定 &lt;實體名稱&gt; 的掉落物，掉落機率為 100%。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd addhand &lt;實體名稱&gt; &lt;掉落機率&gt;</em></span> - 將主手持有的物品添加為指定 &lt;實體名稱&gt; 的掉落物，機率介於 0 至 1.0 之間。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd cleardrops &lt;實體名稱&gt;</em></span> - 清除指定 &lt;實體名稱&gt; 的所有額外掉落物。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>所有指令均需開啟作弊權限。</em></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd usage</em> 指令畫面：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd list</em> 指令。顯示所有可用於 <em>/cemd addhand</em> 與 <em>/cemd cleardrops</em> 的實體名稱。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd addhand &lt;實體名稱&gt;</em> 指令。以 100% 機率為豬添加「小豬生怪蛋」作為掉落物：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"181\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd addhand &lt;實體名稱&gt; &lt;掉落機率&gt;</em> 指令。以 50% 機率為豬添加「小豬生怪蛋」作為掉落物：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"184\"></span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd cleardrops &lt;實體名稱&gt;</em> 指令。清除先前設定的生怪蛋。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"157\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd reload</em> 指令。手動修改 mobdropconfig 檔案後，重新更新掉落物設定。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"166\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>範例：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">將牛奶桶添加至牛死亡時的掉落物範例。使用 <em>/cemd addhand</em> 指令：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/g.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在牛身上測試效果：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/h.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">成功了！出現牛奶桶了！</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/i.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p>位於 '<em>./config/configurableextramobdrops/mobdropconfig.txt</em>'。<br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>原版實體：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"581\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>以及來自 Animalium 等模組的自訂實體：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/k.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"357\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>設定範例：殭屍村民有 50% 機率掉落一本已撰寫的書：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1265\" height=\"303\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>實際效果：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/m.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，您即可自由將其用於任何模組整合包。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有模組的總覽與更多詳細資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於評論區分散於多個模組頁面，難以统一管理，故已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、建議或想法，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a> 進行反饋。感謝支持！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
